{
 "name": "modules-tools-batch-sidecar-stdio",
 "about": "整个工具批次被拒的路径，显式 stdio 部署（PILOTDECK_AGENT_LOOP_TRANSPORT=stdio）下（输入同 modules-tools-batch）：宿主侧的外部工具端口在批次结果数不符（b03）或 toolCallId 不符（b04）时抛错（hostToolPort.ts:215-220、346-355），宿主的耐久工具端口已记 tool_call 而没有 tool_result（durableToolPort.ts:12-21），宿主把错误回成 ok:false 的 module 应答（agentLoopSidecarClient.ts:1088-1092、1238-1251），sidecar 自己的工具端口给每个调用一份 moduleFailureResult（hostToolPort.ts:297、357-376），循环继续，写 step_completed 时宿主的会话校验报 Step 1 completed with unresolved tool calls.（SessionDomainValidation.ts:300-306），sidecar 的循环因此抛错，以不带结果的 failed 终态收尾，宿主报 Sidecar terminal payload does not contain an AgentLoop result.（agentLoopSidecarClient.ts:1320-1326）并记 result_unknown（:695-717）。b02 是模块回结构化失败（每个调用各得一份失败结果、轮次照常完成），b01 / b05 是成功的对照。进程内部署下同样的输入见 modules-tools-batch（轮次以 Step 1 completed with unresolved tool calls. 失败）。sidecar 给外部模块调用起的 requestId 是随机 base36 串，长度随机。",
 "volatile": [
  "^\\$\\.provider\\.m-b\\d+-\\d+\\[\\d+\\]\\.(body\\.requestId|headers\\.content-length)$"
 ],
 "config": "schemaVersion: 1\nagent:\n  model: bbx/deterministic\n  maxContextTokens: 65536\n  maxOutputTokens: 8192\nmodel:\n  providers:\n    bbx:\n      protocol: openai\n      url: {MOCK}/v1\n      apiKey: bbx-mock-only\n      models:\n        deterministic:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\ntelemetry:\n  enabled: false\nmodules:\n  tools:\n    enabled: true\n    implementationId: bbx.tools\n    contract: pilotdeck.tools/v1\n    transport: module-http-v2\n    endpoint: {MOCK}/tools\n    timeoutMs: 1500\n    methods:\n      - execute\n      - execute_batch\n    catalog:\n      - name: bbx_echo\n        description: Echo text through the external capability module.\n        inputSchema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            text:\n              type: string\n          required:\n            - text\n      - name: bbx_lookup\n        description: Look a key up in the external capability module.\n        kind: search\n        readOnly: true\n        concurrencySafe: true\n        inputSchema:\n          type: object\n          properties:\n            key:\n              type: string\n",
